@startuml
' claim: this repository builds from its sysroot with the pinned kyr-build; no tooling copy lives here
actor Developer
participant "utils/deps.sh (wrapper)" as W
participant "build/sysroot" as S
participant "utils/run_pipeline.sh" as P
participant "build/debs" as D
Developer -> W : ./utils/deps.sh sysroot
W -> S : kyr-build <ver> by sha256 from deps.txt, then every other pin
W --> Developer : exports (eval)
Developer -> P : ./utils/run_pipeline.sh
P -> S : source share/kyr-build/gcc_build_profiles.sh (via utils/ wrapper)
P -> P : build every profile, tests, check_hardening.sh
P -> D : build_deb.sh
D --> Developer : *.deb, SHA256SUMS, copied to ~/.cache/rh-deps/debs for the next consumer
@enduml
